   * Insert a sample, keeping the series bucket ordered by timestamp.
   *
   * Returns false and admits nothing when `sample.series` is not yet known
   * and the store already holds `maxSeries` distinct series. A series already
   * present is never rejected on cardinality grounds, no matter how full the
   * store is.
